#!/usr/bin/env node
/**
 * AURA — emoji reactions and voice messages
 *
 *   - Reactions: as well as 👍 and 👎, a message can get ❤️ 😂 😮 😢 😡 or 🔥. Point at a message and
 *     click the smiley. Still one per person per message; pick yours again to take it back.
 *   - Voice messages: the microphone button in the typing box records up to 2 minutes, with the
 *     microphone picked for calls. Stop to listen first, or send straight away; Esc throws it away.
 *     They're private files like pictures: only the people in that chat can play them.
 *   The privacy policy says how both work.
 *
 *   Needs the message search update first (aura-messages-search-setup.cjs).
 *   Also run  supabase/aura-messages-emoji-voice.sql  in Supabase (SQL Editor), once.
 *
 * How to use:  node aura-messages-emoji-voice-setup.cjs      (in your AURA project folder)
 * To undo:     node aura-messages-emoji-voice-setup.cjs --undo
 */
